---
import archive from "../../labs/research/bundle.json";
import coreSource from "../../labs/research/core.mjs?raw";
import graph from "../../labs/research/graph-data.json";
import uiSource from "../../labs/research/ui.mjs?raw";

const runtime = `${coreSource}\n${uiSource.replace(/^import \{[^}]+\} from "\.\/core\.mjs";\s*/, "")}`;
const payload = JSON.stringify({ archive, graph }).replaceAll("<", "\\u003c");
---
<research-playground id="research-lab-playground" class="lab-root">
  <header class="lab-intro">
    <h2>브라우저 실습</h2>
    <button type="button" data-action="download-zip" class="lab-primary">실습 코드 ZIP 다운로드</button>
    <span class="lab-file-note">Python · Cypher · Docker Compose · Jupyter 노트북</span>
  </header>

  <section class="lab-card" aria-labelledby="graph-lab-title">
    <p class="lab-eyebrow">01 · 그래프 탐색</p>
    <h3 id="graph-lab-title">연구 협업 그래프</h3>
    <p>노드 7개, 관계 9개. JSON 기반 관계 탐색. Cypher는 다운로드한 Neo4j 예제에서 실행.</p>
    <div class="lab-controls">
      <label>조회 항목
        <select data-input="graph-query">
          <option value="topics">연구자별 연구 주제</option>
          <option value="shared">같은 주제를 연구하는 사람</option>
          <option value="path">민지 → 소라 최단 경로</option>
        </select>
      </label>
      <button type="button" data-action="run-graph" class="lab-primary">그래프 탐색 실행</button>
      <button type="button" data-action="download-graph" disabled>결과 CSV 다운로드</button>
    </div>
    <div class="lab-graph-grid">
      <div>
        <div class="lab-legend"><span class="lab-person">연구자</span><span class="lab-topic">주제</span><span class="lab-paper">논문</span></div>
        <svg data-view="graph" viewBox="0 0 620 490" role="img" aria-label="연구 협업 네트워크: 노드를 선택하면 속성을 확인할 수 있습니다"></svg>
        <p data-view="node-detail" class="lab-status" aria-live="polite">노드 선택 시 label·속성 표시.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="lab-query-panel">
        <h4>Cypher</h4>
        <p><code>$lab = "research-lab-v1"</code> 매개변수 사용.</p>
        <pre><code data-view="cypher"></code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p data-view="graph-status" class="lab-status" role="status">조회 항목 선택 후 실행.</p>
    <div data-view="graph-results" class="lab-table-wrap"></div>
  </section>

  <section class="lab-card" aria-labelledby="cnn-lab-title">
    <p class="lab-eyebrow">02 · CNN 학습</p>
    <h3 id="cnn-lab-title">가로선·세로선 분류</h3>
    <p>12×12 합성 선 이미지 2종, 매개변수 50개. 학습 80개, 검증 40개.</p>
    <p class="lab-architecture">12×12×1 → Conv 3×3, 4개 → ReLU → 전역 평균 → Linear 4→2</p>
    <div class="lab-controls">
      <label>학습 횟수(epoch)
        <select data-input="epochs"><option value="20">20회</option><option value="40" selected>40회</option><option value="60">60회</option></select>
      </label>
      <label>학습률
        <select data-input="learning-rate"><option value="0.1">0.1</option><option value="0.3" selected>0.3</option><option value="0.8">0.8</option></select>
      </label>
      <button type="button" data-action="train" class="lab-primary">처음부터 학습</button>
      <button type="button" data-action="stop" disabled>학습 중단</button>
      <button type="button" data-action="reset">초기화</button>
    </div>
    <progress data-view="progress" max="40" value="0" aria-label="CNN 학습 진행률"></progress>
    <p data-view="training-status" class="lab-status" role="status">seed 7 · 학습 전</p>
    <div class="lab-metrics">
      <div><span>학습 loss</span><strong data-view="train-loss">—</strong></div>
      <div><span>검증 정확도</span><strong data-view="accuracy">—</strong></div>
      <div><span>완료 epoch</span><strong data-view="epoch">0</strong></div>
    </div>
    <div class="lab-cnn-grid">
      <div class="lab-sample">
        <h4>검증 이미지</h4>
        <canvas data-view="sample" width="192" height="192" aria-label="선택한 12×12 검증 이미지"></canvas>
        <p data-view="prediction"></p>
        <button type="button" data-action="next-sample">다른 검증 이미지</button>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h4>loss 변화</h4>
        <svg data-view="loss-chart" viewBox="0 0 400 220" role="img" aria-label="epoch별 학습·검증 loss 그래프"></svg>
        <div class="lab-legend"><span class="lab-person">학습 loss</span><span class="lab-topic">검증 loss</span></div>
        <p class="lab-muted">Cross-entropy loss. 학습·검증 데이터별 기록.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <h4>합성곱 필터와 특징 맵</h4>
    <div class="lab-filters">
      <canvas data-view="kernel-0" width="90" height="90" aria-label="학습 중인 3×3 필터 1"></canvas>
      <canvas data-view="kernel-1" width="90" height="90" aria-label="학습 중인 3×3 필터 2"></canvas>
      <canvas data-view="kernel-2" width="90" height="90" aria-label="학습 중인 3×3 필터 3"></canvas>
      <canvas data-view="kernel-3" width="90" height="90" aria-label="학습 중인 3×3 필터 4"></canvas>
      <div class="lab-feature-map"><canvas data-view="feature-map" width="120" height="120" aria-label="선택한 이미지의 첫 필터 특징 맵"></canvas><span>첫 필터의 ReLU 출력</span></div>
    </div>
    <p class="lab-muted">파랑: 양수 / 주황: 음수. 합성곱 필터와 분류층 가중치 학습.</p>
    <div data-view="confusion" class="lab-table-wrap"></div>
    <div class="lab-controls">
      <button type="button" data-action="download-metrics" disabled>학습 기록 CSV 다운로드</button>
      <button type="button" data-action="download-model" disabled>결과·가중치 JSON 다운로드</button>
    </div>
  </section>
  <script is:inline type="application/json" data-lab-payload set:html={payload} />
</research-playground>
<script is:inline type="module" set:html={runtime} />

<style>
  .lab-root{display:block;color:#25304a;--lab-bg:#fff;--lab-code-bg:#f5f6fb;--lab-border:#d9deea;--lab-accent:#6655ba;scroll-margin-top:6rem}
  :global(.dark) .lab-root{color:#e6eaf3;--lab-bg:#202535;--lab-code-bg:#171d2b;--lab-border:#3b4358;--lab-accent:#b4a7ff}
  .lab-intro,.lab-card{margin:1.5rem 0;padding:clamp(1rem,3vw,1.6rem);border:1px solid var(--lab-border);border-radius:1rem;background:var(--lab-bg)}
  h2{font-size:1.6rem;font-weight:750;line-height:1.4;margin:.4rem 0 1rem}h3{font-size:1.25rem;font-weight:700;line-height:1.5;margin:.3rem 0 .8rem}h4{font-size:1rem;font-weight:650;margin:1rem 0 .7rem}
  p{line-height:1.8;margin:.6rem 0}.lab-eyebrow{color:var(--lab-accent);font-size:.8rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.04em}.lab-muted,.lab-file-note{font-size:.85rem;opacity:.7}.lab-file-note{display:block;margin-top:.6rem}
  .lab-controls{display:flex;align-items:end;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.6rem;margin:1rem 0}.lab-controls label{display:grid;gap:.4rem;font-size:.85rem}
  button,select{font:inherit;font-size:.85rem;border:1px solid var(--lab-border);border-radius:.6rem;padding:.65rem .85rem;background:var(--lab-bg);color:inherit;min-height:2.7rem}
  .lab-controls select{width:100%;min-width:0}button{cursor:pointer}button:hover:not(:disabled){border-color:var(--lab-accent)}button:disabled{opacity:.4;cursor:not-allowed}.lab-primary{background:#6655ba;color:#fff;font-weight:700}
  button:focus-visible,select:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--lab-accent);outline-offset:3px}
  .lab-graph-grid,.lab-cnn-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:1.2rem}.lab-query-panel{min-width:0}
  svg[data-view=graph]{width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:.7rem;background:var(--lab-code-bg)}
  pre{white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;padding:1rem;border-radius:.7rem;background:var(--lab-code-bg);font-size:.75rem;line-height:1.8;margin:.6rem 0}
  code{font-family:ui-monospace,monospace}.lab-status{font-size:.85rem;min-height:1.6rem}.lab-legend{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:1rem;margin:.6rem 0;font-size:.8rem}.lab-legend span:before{content:"";display:inline-block;width:.55rem;height:.55rem;border-radius:50%;margin-right:.35rem;background:currentColor}
  .lab-person{color:#6477db}.lab-topic{color:#d18b24}.lab-paper{color:#258d79}
  .lab-table-wrap{overflow-x:auto;margin:1rem 0}.lab-table-wrap :global(table){width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:.85rem}.lab-table-wrap :global(th),.lab-table-wrap :global(td){padding:.65rem;text-align:left;border-bottom:1px solid var(--lab-border)}
  .lab-table-wrap :global(th){font-weight:650;background:var(--lab-code-bg)}
  .lab-architecture{font: .8rem/1.7 ui-monospace,monospace;padding:.8rem;background:var(--lab-code-bg);border-radius:.6rem;overflow-wrap:anywhere}
  progress{display:block;width:100%;height:.7rem;accent-color:var(--lab-accent)}
  .lab-metrics{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:.7rem;margin:1rem 0}.lab-metrics>div{padding:.8rem;border-radius:.7rem;background:var(--lab-code-bg)}.lab-metrics span{display:block;font-size:.75rem;opacity:.7}.lab-metrics strong{display:block;font-size:1.5rem;margin-top:.3rem}
  .lab-sample canvas{display:block;max-width:100%;border-radius:.5rem;image-rendering:pixelated}.lab-sample p{font-size:.8rem}
  svg[data-view=loss-chart]{width:100%;max-height:240px;background:var(--lab-code-bg);border-radius:.6rem}
  .lab-filters{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:1rem;align-items:center}.lab-filters canvas{border-radius:.3rem;image-rendering:pixelated;max-width:100%}.lab-feature-map{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.7rem;font-size:.75rem;opacity:.8}
  @media(max-width:700px){.lab-graph-grid,.lab-cnn-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.lab-metrics strong{font-size:1.2rem}.lab-controls>button{flex-grow:1}.lab-controls label{flex:1;min-width:120px}}
</style>
